rson-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kolokoltsov</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name><name><surname>Weaver</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Davey</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Efficient functional pseudotyping of oncoretroviral and lentiviral vectors by Venezuelan equine encephalitis virus envelope proteins</article-title><source>J Virol</source><year>2005</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>756</fpage><lpage>763</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15613303</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/JVI.79.2.756-763.2005</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>World: Towards a unified nomenclature system for the highly pathogenic H5N1 avian influenza viruses</article-title><source>Healh Organization Epidemic and Pandemic Alert and Response</source><year>2007</year><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.who.int/csr/disease/avian_influenza/guidelines/nomenclature/en/index.html"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>